---
// Sección 4 — La Transformación
---

<section id="transformacion" class="trf sec">
  <canvas class="trf-canvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>

  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow trf-eyebrow trf-reveal" style="--del:0s">La Transformación</p>

    <h2 class="trf-h2 trf-reveal" style="--del:0.1s">
      De la confusión <span class="accent">a la claridad.</span>
    </h2>

    <p class="trf-sub trf-reveal" style="--del:0.2s">
      Así cambia tu vida cuando entendés cómo funciona el dinero.
    </p>

    <div class="trf-grid">

      <!-- Card ANTES -->
      <div class="trf-card card-antes">
        <p class="trf-card-header">ANTES</p>
        <ul class="trf-list">
          <li class="trf-item">
            <svg class="trf-icon icon-x" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
              <path d="m15 9-6 6"/>
              <path d="m9 9 6 6"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Confusión y ruido constante</span>
          </li>
          <li class="trf-item">
            <svg class="trf-icon icon-x" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
              <path d="m15 9-6 6"/>
              <path d="m9 9 6 6"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Miedo a cometer errores</span>
          </li>
          <li class="trf-item">
            <svg class="trf-icon icon-x" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
              <path d="m15 9-6 6"/>
              <path d="m9 9 6 6"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Esperando el momento perfecto</span>
          </li>
          <li class="trf-item">
            <svg class="trf-icon icon-x" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
              <path d="m15 9-6 6"/>
              <path d="m9 9 6 6"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Riesgo de estafas</span>
          </li>
          <li class="trf-item">
            <svg class="trf-icon icon-x" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
              <path d="m15 9-6 6"/>
              <path d="m9 9 6 6"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Sin saber por dónde empezar</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Línea de energía -->
      <div class="trf-energy" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="trf-energy-line">
          <div class="trf-energy-dot"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card DESPUÉS -->
      <div class="trf-card card-despues">
        <p class="trf-card-header">DESPUÉS</p>
        <ul class="trf-list">
          <li class="trf-item">
            <svg class="trf-icon icon-check" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/>
              <polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Entendés cómo funciona Bitcoin</span>
          </li>
          <li class="trf-item">
            <svg class="trf-icon icon-check" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/>
              <polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Comprás y custodiás con seguridad</span>
          </li>
          <li class="trf-item">
            <svg class="trf-icon icon-check" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/>
              <polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Actuás con un plan, no con ansiedad</span>
          </li>
          <li class="trf-item">
            <svg class="trf-icon icon-check" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/>
              <polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Sabés proteger tu dinero</span>
          </li>
          <li class="trf-item">
            <svg class="trf-icon icon-check" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/>
